This directory contains the track "PhantomaOS - Advanced Computer System", created by Lena Raine.
The track was uploaded for a future "jukebox" system as one of the songs (as it's CC BY-SA).

Original on Bandcamp:
<https://radicaldreamland.bandcamp.com/track/phantomaos-advanced-computer-system>

Per the Bandcamp description, "PhantomaOS" is under CC BY-SA 4.0.

phantoma.opus was transcoded to 192 kbps Opus from the Bandcamp WAV release.
If you want a lossless WAV/FLAC, just name your price on Bandcamp!
